<Window x:Class="Revenant_Theme_Studio.ConsentDialog"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="Revenant Theme Studio — Advanced Operations"
        Width="680" Height="540"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner"
        ResizeMode="NoResize"
        ShowInTaskbar="False">

    <Window.Background>
        <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1">
            <GradientStop Color="#002414" Offset="0"/>
            <GradientStop Color="#000a05" Offset="1"/>
        </LinearGradientBrush>
    </Window.Background>

    <Grid Margin="28">
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <!-- Header -->
        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
            <TextBlock Text="ADVANCED SYSTEM OPERATIONS"
                       FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="18" FontWeight="Bold"
                       Foreground="#C4962B"/>
            <Rectangle Height="1" Fill="#4a3a20" Margin="0,8,0,0"/>
        </StackPanel>

        <!-- Subtitle -->
        <TextBlock Grid.Row="1"
                   FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="13" Foreground="#997a4c"
                   TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,14"
                   Text="You are about to use features that modify system-level Windows settings. Please read the following before continuing."/>

        <!-- Body -->
        <Border Grid.Row="2" Background="#55000a05" BorderBrush="#00422a"
                BorderThickness="1" Padding="16" Margin="0,0,0,16">
            <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                <TextBlock FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="13" Foreground="#C4962B"
                           TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="22">
                    <TextBlock.Text>
BY CLICKING "I AGREE", YOU AUTHORIZE REVENANT THEME STUDIO (RTS) TO PERFORM THE FOLLOWING ACTIONS ON YOUR SYSTEM:

1. REGISTRY MODIFICATIONS
   RTS will read and write to the Windows Registry under HKEY_CURRENT_USER. This is used to assign custom icons to drives and Windows shell locations (Desktop, Documents, etc.). No system-wide (HKLM) registry keys are modified without your explicit action.

2. PROTECTED ICON FILE EDITS
   If you use the Shell Icons feature, RTS may modify imageres.dll.mun or related protected Windows icon resources. This requires administrator privileges and modifies system files. A backup is recommended before use.

3. REGISTRY SNAPSHOT
   Immediately upon your agreement, RTS will save a snapshot of all relevant registry keys to:
   C:\ProgramData\Revenant Theme Studio\registry_snapshot.json
   This snapshot represents your system's state BEFORE any RTS changes and can be used to restore your original configuration.

4. ICON FILE PRESERVATION
   When you close RTS, all icon files you have applied will be copied to:
   C:\ProgramData\Revenant Theme Studio\Icons\
   This prevents broken icon links if your source files are later moved or deleted.

5. YOUR RIGHTS
   You may undo any change made by RTS at any time using the Undo / Restore feature (Pro). You may also manually restore the registry snapshot at any time by importing the JSON-exported .reg file from the path above.

RTS does not connect to the internet, does not collect telemetry, and does not modify any files outside of the paths described above.

This agreement is stored locally and you will not be asked again on this machine.
                    </TextBlock.Text>
                </TextBlock>
            </ScrollViewer>
        </Border>

        <!-- Checkbox confirmation -->
        <CheckBox x:Name="ConfirmCheck" Grid.Row="3"
                  Content="I have read and understand the above. I authorize RTS to perform these operations."
                  Foreground="#997a4c" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="13"
                  Margin="0,0,0,16"/>

        <!-- Buttons -->
        <StackPanel Grid.Row="4" Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
            <Button Content="Decline" Width="120" Padding="10,8"
                    FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="13"
                    Background="#001a0e" Foreground="#5a4820"
                    BorderBrush="#2a1a0a" BorderThickness="1"
                    Cursor="Hand" Click="Decline_Click" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
            <Button x:Name="AcceptButton" Content="I Agree — Proceed" Width="200" Padding="10,8"
                    FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="13" FontWeight="Bold"
                    BorderBrush="#C4962B" BorderThickness="1"
                    Cursor="Hand" Click="Accept_Click" IsEnabled="False">
                <Button.Background>
                    <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1">
                        <GradientStop Color="#C4962B" Offset="0"/>
                        <GradientStop Color="#7a5e30" Offset="1"/>
                    </LinearGradientBrush>
                </Button.Background>
                <Button.Foreground>
                    <SolidColorBrush Color="#001a0e"/>
                </Button.Foreground>
            </Button>
        </StackPanel>
    </Grid>
</Window>
